<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="AI-based vehicle damage assessment using image processing and computer vision.">
    <title>AIM002 | Vehicle Damage Assessment</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='style.css') }}">
</head>

<body>
    <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">
            <span class="brand-mark">A</span>
            <div>
                <div class="brand-name">AIM002</div>
                <div class="brand-subtitle">Vehicle Damage Assessment System</div>
            </div>
        </div>

```
    <div class="system-status">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        Image Analysis System
    </div>
</header>

<main class="page">

    <section class="hero-card">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <p class="eyebrow">COMPUTER VISION · IMAGE PROCESSING</p>

            <h1>Vehicle Damage Assessment</h1>

            <p class="hero-description">
                Upload a vehicle photograph to analyze visible damage,
                inspect detected regions, and estimate damage severity
                using our image-processing pipeline.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="upload-card" id="uploadCard">
            <div class="upload-icon">↑</div>

            <h3>Select a Vehicle Photograph</h3>

            <p>Upload a clear image of the damaged vehicle.</p>

            <p class="upload-help">
                Supported formats: JPG, JPEG, PNG, BMP, WEBP · Maximum 25 MB
            </p>

            <input
                type="file"
                id="imageInput"
                accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/bmp,image/webp"
                hidden
            >

            <button type="button" class="select-button" id="selectImageButton">
                Choose Image
            </button>

            <p class="selected-file" id="fileName" aria-live="polite">
                No image selected
            </p>

            <img
                id="selectedImagePreview"
                alt="Preview of the selected vehicle"
                style="display:none; max-width:100%; max-height:300px; margin-top:18px; object-fit:contain;"
            >

            <p class="upload-error hidden" id="uploadError" role="alert"></p>

            <button
                type="button"
                class="analyze-button"
                id="analyzeButton"
                disabled
            >
                Analyze Image
            </button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="results" id="aim002LiveResults" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">ASSESSMENT REPORT</p>
                <h2>Vehicle Damage Analysis</h2>
                <p class="section-description">
                    Your assessment results will appear here after analysis.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="loading-card" id="resultsPlaceholder">
            <h3>Waiting for an image</h3>
            <p>Select a vehicle photograph and click "Analyze Image" to begin.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="technical-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">PROCESSING PIPELINE</p>
                <h2>How the Assessment Works</h2>
                <p class="section-description">
                    The system processes the uploaded image through four stages.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="technical-grid">
            <div class="technical-item">
                <span>Stage 01</span>
                <strong>Image Preprocessing</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="technical-item">
                <span>Stage 02</span>
                <strong>Vehicle Segmentation</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="technical-item">
                <span>Stage 03</span>
                <strong>Damage Region Detection</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="technical-item">
                <span>Stage 04</span>
                <strong>Damage Assessment</strong>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="results-footer">
        <p>AIM002 · Vehicle Damage Assessment System</p>
        <p>This tool estimates visible damage and does not replace a professional vehicle inspection.</p>
    </footer>

</main>

<script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='app.js') }}" defer></script>
```

</body>
</html>
